#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:1 ad5cf2366f414911bf9f853607815420
msgid "📝 Documentation"
msgstr "📝 文档编写"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:3 0b01fedad2f34338be445f4b378e75ac
msgid ""
"Bookshelf aims to make map making simple. Good documentation is part of "
"that. Document every feature that you add."
msgstr "Bookshelf 的目标是让地图制作变得简单。好的文档是其中的一部分。请为你添加的每个特性编写文档。"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:7 223cfb7e71374b588b7bcd0534aaf310
msgid "Write the documentation"
msgstr "撰写文档"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:9 2e4b0f8b4fc443a9942b3b7f9f2dd281
msgid ""
"The documentation uses Markdown with the [MyST Parser](https://myst-"
"parser.readthedocs.io/en/latest/intro.html) extensions. Images go in the "
"`/docs/_imgs` folder."
msgstr ""
"文档使用 Markdown 编写，并带有 [MyST Parser](https://myst-"
"parser.readthedocs.io/en/latest/intro.html) 扩展。图像放在 `/docs/_imgs` 文件夹中。"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:11 f46bf234139e4aee91409287a64c9af9
msgid ""
"Each module has a page in `docs/modules`. The page name is the module "
"name without the `bs.` prefix. For example, the page of `bs.health` is "
"`docs/modules/health.md`. To add or change a page, follow the structure "
"of the other pages."
msgstr ""
"每个模块在 `docs/modules` 中都有一个页面。页面名称是去掉 `bs.` 前缀的模块名。例如，`bs.health` 的页面是 "
"`docs/modules/health.md`。添加或修改页面时，请遵循其他页面的结构。"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:16 48b041c23ac646c39e2da3173b8edbd7
msgid "Feature directive"
msgstr "特性指令"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:18 434fe1412dfb4dbbafca3dd78b9f5482
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Don't write the description, inputs, and outputs of a feature on the "
"page. They come from the [metadata](project:metadata.md). The `{feature}`"
" directive shows them. Add one directive for each feature, on the first "
"line after its heading:"
msgstr ""
"不要在页面中写特性的描述、输入和输出。它们来自[元数据](project:metadata.md)，由 `{feature}` "
"指令显示。请为每个特性添加一个指令，放在其标题之后的第一行："

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:38 7b03e35855734432a02cba082b4ffcc4
msgid ""
"The content of the directive is optional. It appears after the inputs and"
" outputs."
msgstr "指令的内容是可选的。它显示在输入和输出之后。"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:39 9a24c6a6e4514c988f55086e4a787946
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If two features of different types have the same ID, write the type "
"first: `` {feature} predicate bs.hitbox:get_entity/sized ``."
msgstr ""
"如果两个不同类型的特性拥有相同的 ID，请先写类型：`` {feature} predicate "
"bs.hitbox:get_entity/sized ``。"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:41 696ec539916f48fca25b83c5b64032d7
msgid ""
"Use the rest of the page for what the metadata can't say: ideas that "
"several features share, examples, and images."
msgstr "页面的其余部分用来说明元数据无法表达的内容：多个特性共享的概念、示例和图像。"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:45 f1cf0ae3b60e4e77a81698af8232ac4e
msgid "Build the documentation"
msgstr "构建文档"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:47 5cf864a2b9ba4a95958f1edb4aceccbc
msgid "To check your changes, build the documentation on your computer."
msgstr "要检查你的更改，请在你的电脑上构建文档。"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:49 3d6971183e0b4e409872e7637b9ddccf
msgid "Option 1: Build once"
msgstr "选项 1：构建一次"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:55 3feada1fc8744d228e7914b1da4eefa3
msgid "This command writes the documentation to the `/docs/_build` folder."
msgstr "此命令将文档写入 `/docs/_build` 文件夹。"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:57 0fe590d1ee884813bd0584ce567f46ba
msgid "Option 2: Build with hot reload"
msgstr "选项 2：支持热重载的构建"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:63 469c92a0aa294e18be80278d82d5cfa4
msgid ""
"This command builds the documentation and serves it at "
"`http://127.0.0.1:8000`. The browser updates each time you change a page "
"or a `module.bs` file."
msgstr "此命令会构建文档，并在 `http://127.0.0.1:8000` 提供访问。每当你修改页面或 `module.bs` 文件时，浏览器都会更新。"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:67 1dab9a7e35794a369d4a9f5e6f6ecb29
msgid "Translations"
msgstr "翻译"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:69 d20f34a14a5b47dd8e2601f35e1d01a7
msgid "The translations are `.po` files in the `/docs/_locales` folder."
msgstr "翻译是 `/docs/_locales` 文件夹中的 `.po` 文件。"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:72 c7b4b688df124e19ad9348d496ed96d1
msgid "`uv run docs locales update`"
msgstr "`uv run docs locales update`"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:73 eb945c050f984f308164b0788fe2cd21
msgid "Update the files of every language with the latest changes"
msgstr "根据最新变更更新所有语言的文件"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:74 1a2c4d5631fe437c8c7e1aa7c82c37f7
msgid "`uv run docs locales add <lang>`"
msgstr "`uv run docs locales add <lang>`"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:75 3d5a4f5c43034c31a5a1c1c818ad8045
msgid "Create the files of a new language"
msgstr "创建新语言的文件"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:76 426fd2965a0e41d7bd2231c61fd1ef3d
msgid "`uv run docs build --lang <lang>`"
msgstr "`uv run docs build --lang <lang>`"

#: ../../contribute/documentation.md:77 73ddc482c1bc49348d22bd6b85f70ef0
msgid "Build the documentation in one language"
msgstr "以某一种语言构建文档"

